OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FCloudy with
OL,6,Foutbreaks of rain this evening and
OL,7,Finto the night, turning heavy at
OL,8,Ftimes. Becoming drier later in the
OL,9,Fnight with a few clear intervals.
OL,10,
OL,11,CFriday:FA day of sunny intervals and
OL,12,Fblustery showers, these heavier and
OL,13,Fmore frequent across Argyll. Windy.
OL,14,
OL,15,COutlook for Saturday to Monday:FSunny
OL,16,Fintervals and some heavy showers on
OL,17,FSaturday, breezy. Mainly dry and
OL,18,Fbright Sunday, winds easing. Monday
OL,19,Fclouding over with some patchy rain.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
